# Dependencies and build output are installed or produced inside the image.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/build
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/storybook-static
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log

# Secrets and env examples. NEXT_PUBLIC_* values are passed as build args
# or a BuildKit secret. Never copy env files into the image.
**/.env
**/.env.*

.git
.github
.vscode
.idea
.cursor
**/.DS_Store

# Not needed to build the web client.
apps/backend/supabase
**/.supabase
agent-transcripts
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
